OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on derelict WW2 tower
OL,4,Aas #3.7m raised
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to redevelop a derelict
OL,7,FWorld War Two RAF building as a holiday
OL,8,Flet.
OL,10,FThe Landmark Trust said it had raised
OL,11,Fmore than #3.7m from 1,420 supporters
OL,12,Fto enable the conversion of the former
OL,13,FRAF Ibsley control tower near Ringwood,
OL,14,FHampshire.
OL,16,FThe airfield was a station for
OL,17,FSpitfires and US fighter-bombers, as
OL,18,Fwell as being a set for the 1942 war
OL,19,Ffilm The First of the Few.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
